# DSW-4 unit and integration benches. Only sources, scripts and small
# reference results are tracked. Builds, GHDL binaries, copied stimulus and
# the gold traces (849 MB; regenerate with diag/work-spec/gold.py) are
# scratch.
*
!.gitignore
!*/
work/
build*/
gold/
out/
synth/
__pycache__/
b1/*/
!*.py
!*.vhd
!core/*.log
!writer/final_regress.txt
!writer/mut_result.txt
!front/final_all.log
